01:14:08.520 --> 01:14:10.242
Thanks, Jason.

01:14:10.242 --> 01:14:10.950
That was amazing.

01:14:20.020 --> 01:14:21.020
So, we're going to chat.

01:14:26.200 --> 01:14:29.140
Although, I'm still sort
of coming down from that.

01:14:32.700 --> 01:14:33.200
Thanks.

01:14:33.200 --> 01:14:34.160
I tried to bring
it down at the end.

01:14:34.160 --> 01:14:35.210
Yeah, no, it was good.

01:14:39.380 --> 01:14:41.380
I don't know if you guys
had the same experience

01:14:41.380 --> 01:14:43.730
but, I was sort of wondering,
do I look at the code,

01:14:43.730 --> 01:14:46.090
do I look at the
screen, because they

01:14:46.090 --> 01:14:48.120
were both very interesting.

01:14:48.120 --> 01:14:54.740
So, I wanted to have the
