01:15:05.500 --> 01:15:08.600
Right, right that's
probably a good idea.

01:15:08.600 --> 01:15:10.070
You're a Vim guy, OK.

01:15:10.070 --> 01:15:11.750
Well, we won't get
into editor wars

01:15:11.750 --> 01:15:13.800
right now because
that's a whole--

01:15:16.940 --> 01:15:20.330
I'm using Vim key bindings.

01:15:20.330 --> 01:15:21.680
Vim key bindings.

01:15:21.680 --> 01:15:23.180
So we're good.

01:15:23.180 --> 01:15:24.163
OK, so, look--

01:15:24.163 --> 01:15:25.580
I think she started
a war already.

01:15:25.580 --> 01:15:27.860
Yeah, don't start
the editor war.

01:15:32.380 --> 01:15:36.050
But I have to say, I
thought it worked OK

01:15:36.050 --> 01:15:44.030
because it was, code on top of
art might be a little too much,

01:15:44.030 --> 01:15:45.560
it's pretty busy.

01:15:45.560 --> 01:15:52.040
Just out of curiosity,
oh turn your mic up.

01:15:52.040 --> 01:15:54.710
So, out of the
